    "以系统声音轨为参考消掉扬声器串进麦克风的声音，并压制底噪；离线处理一次，之后预览与导出共用，关闭即回到原始声音。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses the system audio track as a reference to remove speaker bleed from the microphone and reduce background noise. Processed once offline and shared by preview and export; turn it off to restore the original sound."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会移到废纸篓，可从访达恢复。": {
